   "title": "Nvidia confirms planned supply of GPUs to S. Korea despite Huang's resignation: science minister",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/business/20261113/nvidia-confirms-planned-supply-of-gpus-to-s-korea-despite-jensen-huangs-resignation-science-minister",
