   "title": "Woori Bank chief wins extra year as rivals await term decisions",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/business/banking-finance/20261113/woori-bank-chief-wins-extra-year-as-rivals-await-term-decisions",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
