   "title": "ABB India Q3 profit rises 10% to ₹440 crore; orders hit record ₹4,733 crore",
   "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/business/Industry/abb-india-q3-profit-rises-10-to-440-crore-orders-hit-record-4733-crore/article71698661.ece",
