   "summary": "PDP’s Oladipupo Adebutu has hailed a Federal High Court ruling directing INEC to restore his name to the list of candidates for the Ogun 2027 governorship Read More: https://punchng.com/ogun-2027-justice-has-prevailed-adebutu-hails-court-order-against-inec/",
   "summary_zh": "人民民主党（PDP）的奥拉迪普波·阿德布图赞扬联邦高等法院的一项裁决，该裁决指示独立国家选举委员会（INEC）将他的名字恢复到奥贡州2027年州长选举候选人名单中。阅读更多：https://punchng.com/ogun-2027-justice-has-prevailed-adebutu-hails-court-order-against-inec/",
