   "title": "Palace hopeful on South China Sea COC under PH’s Asean chairmanship",
   "url": "https://www.inquirer.net/495498/palace-hopeful-on-south-china-sea-coc-under-phs-asean-chairmanship/",
   "domain": "inquirer.net",
   "source": "inquirer.net",
   "published": "Thu, 12 Nov 2026 19:50:00 +0000",
   "_dt": 1794513000.0,
   "ageDays": 0.81,
   "summary": "This is despite reports that the COC will be unlikely to be settled during the Philippines’ hosting of the 49th Asean Summit and Related Summits on Nov. “Sa ngayon, hindi rin natin masasabi kung talagang hindi na ito magkakaroon ng konklusyon sa 49th Asean Summit dahil ang gusto pa rin ng Pangulo ay ito ay maisapinal sa panahon na ang Pilipinas ang siyang Asean chair,” said Palace press officer Claire Castro at a briefing.",
   "summary_zh": "尽管有报道称，在菲律宾于11月主办第49届东盟峰会及相关峰会期间，中菲共同所有权争议不太可能得到解决，但情况并非如此。总统府新闻官克莱尔·卡斯特罗在记者会上表示：“目前，我们也不能确定这一争议在第49届东盟峰会期间是否确实无法达成结论，因为总统仍希望在菲律宾担任东盟轮值主席国期间解决这个问题。”",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "This is despite reports that the COC will be unlikely to be settled during the Philippines’ hosting of the 49th Asean Summit and Related Summits on Nov. 15 to 17. “Sa ngayon, hindi rin natin masasabi kung talagang hindi na ito magkakaroon ng konklusyon sa 49th Asean Summit dahil ang gusto pa rin ng Pangulo ay ito ay maisapinal sa panahon na ang Pilipinas ang siyang Asean chair,” said Palace press officer Claire Castro at a briefing. In a briefing last week, Castro said Marcos is aiming to once and for all have the COC finalized after years of delay. READ: Marcos wants South China Sea code of conduct finalized during Asean The proposed Code of Conduct is intended to establish rules governing the behavior of countries in the disputed waters and prevent incidents that could lead to armed conflict. An Associated Press report, however, said talks regarding this may have to continue next year when the Asean leadership rotates to Singapore. The last major points that need to be agreed upon are the geographic scope to be covered by the agreement, the definition of sensitive terms, and whether the accord should be legally binding or not, the report said. /gsg",
   "bodyLevel": "fulltext",
   "country": [
    "ph",
    "vn"
   ],
   "topic": [
    "sec"
   ],
   "tier": 1,
   "actor": "中国",
