   "title": "Yeo Jin-goo surprises fans with bulked-up physique in military uniform",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/entertainment/20261112/yeo-jin-goo-surprises-fans-with-bulked-up-physique-in-military-uniform",
