   "title": "Trump’s Russian Diesel Turned Around at Sea. Your Diesel Bill Didn’t.",
   "url": "https://energynewsbeat.co/diesel/trumps-russian-diesel-turned-around-at-sea-your-diesel-bill-didnt/",
