   "title": "Troops apprehend father, son for alleged terrorism in Sokoto forest",
   "url": "https://www.vanguardngr.com/2026/11/troops-%e2%81%a0%e2%81%a0%e2%81%a0apprehend-father-son/",
   "domain": "vanguardngr.com",
